          "type": "AnnotationPage",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.iiif.json/note/4",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Choose S, M, L or Max</h3><p>Use L for one large line or Max when the message should fill the screen and may wrap. S and M leave more space around the words.</p><p>The message has the intended scale.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.html#step-4\">Follow this step in Display Large Text and Welcome Messages on TV</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.iiif.json/note/5",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Set the position and colours</h3><p>Choose one of nine positions and a readable text/background combination. Keep the words clear from the farthest audience position.</p><p>The layout suits the screen and the room.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.html#step-5\">Follow this step in Display Large Text and Welcome Messages on TV</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.iiif.json/note/6",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Choose Show now and update when needed</h3><p>Show the message on the display. Change the wording, position or available styling from the controller when the next instruction is needed.</p><p>The room has the current instruction.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.html#step-6\">Follow this step in Display Large Text and Welcome Messages on TV</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-large-text-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            }
          ]
